    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Rural wharves constructed or rehabilitated 
Indicator: At least 11 wharves and jetties  constructed or rehabilitated by 2014 
Progress/Status: 5 wharves in Nu&amp;apos;usi, Siota (and a landing ramp), Mbunikalo (and a landing ramp), Katurasele, and Manikaraku were completed during the Phase 1. Additional 8 wharves were constructed at Ringgi, Western Province; Keru, Western Province; Ngasini, Western Province; Tatamba, Isabel Province; Susubona, Isabel Province; Lambulambu, Western Province; Vuranggo, Choiseul Province; Lengana, Western Province; and a landing ramp at Uhu, Malaita Province were constructed or rehabilitated under Phase 2. 

